        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_6ad5f6c50c00c40e2340",
          "document_start": 2421,
          "document_end": 2492,
          "text": "What is depicted in Figure 2.32 is a simple, centered rarefaction wave.",
          "section_id": "section_c47a27f38420",
          "start": 2421,
          "end": 2492,
          "chunk_start": 2421,
          "chunk_end": 2492,
          "sentence_document_start": 2421,
          "sentence_document_end": 2492,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_f65f203c9dd37437078d",
          "document_start": 2493,
          "document_end": 2598,
          "text": "A wave is considered simple if all the characteristics (the rays emanating from the origin) are straight.",
          "section_id": "section_c47a27f38420",
          "start": 2493,
          "end": 2598,
          "chunk_start": 2493,
          "chunk_end": 2598,
          "sentence_document_start": 2493,
          "sentence_document_end": 2598,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_5748a766f17842a950c3",
          "document_start": 2599,
          "document_end": 2680,
          "text": "Reflections of a rarefaction are somewhat more complicated than those of a shock.",
          "section_id": "section_c47a27f38420",
          "start": 2599,
          "end": 2680,
          "chunk_start": 2599,
          "chunk_end": 2680,
          "sentence_document_start": 2599,
          "sentence_document_end": 2680,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_d1c8b352f67ed7b21ea4",
          "document_start": 2681,
          "document_end": 2843,
          "text": "The reflection of the head of the rarefaction wave must pass through the characteristics of the rest of the wave being both affected by as well as affecting them.",
          "section_id": "section_c47a27f38420",
          "start": 2681,
          "end": 2843,
          "chunk_start": 2681,
          "chunk_end": 2843,
          "sentence_document_start": 2681,
          "sentence_document_end": 2843,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a66f7e7bd47911e7e1fc",
          "document_start": 2844,
          "document_end": 2943,
          "text": "The result is that the characteristics tend to bend, making the calculations somewhat more complex.",
          "section_id": "section_c47a27f38420",
          "start": 2844,
          "end": 2943,
          "chunk_start": 2844,
          "chunk_end": 2943,
          "sentence_document_start": 2844,
          "sentence_document_end": 2943,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_8c0d60ae9d498ac1ec22",
          "document_start": 2944,
          "document_end": 3120,
          "text": "We will handle this in a simplified fashion later, but the interested reader is directed to Cooper and Kurowski [16] for an outstanding treatment for handling these situations.",
          "section_id": "section_c47a27f38420",
          "start": 2944,
          "end": 3120,
          "chunk_start": 2944,
          "chunk_end": 3120,
          "sentence_document_start": 2944,
